  "translation": "Na ol i tokim em: Tanimhet — putim han bilong yu long maus bilong yu, na yu go wantaim yumi, na yu kamap papa bilong yumi na pris bilong yumi. Em i gutpela moa — yu kamap pris long haus bilong wanpela man, o yu kamap pris long wanpela lain na wanpela famili long Yisrael?",
